abstract: >-
  OpenFOAM v2412 chtMultiRegionFoam axisymmetric conjugate heat-transfer model of
  a 13-stack LiSi/FeS2 thermal battery with LiF-LiCl-LiBr molten-salt electrolyte.
  Reproduces Jeong, Cho and Lee (2019, J. Power Sources 424:35-41) at +26.85 C
  and extends the model to five ambient temperatures from -40 to +50 C for
  operability envelope, discharge derating, and cold-ambient rescue-pellet
  energy-split accounting. Includes YAML case configurations, build and
  extraction scripts, per-region extractions cited in the associated
  publication, and figure-generation code.
